    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ratatata</i> is an isometric Tower Defense game where you lead a space rat kingdom fending off a ruthless cat invasion! Fight across diverse environments and adapt your strategies to survive the relentless waves of these fierce felines!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 24 <i>racruits</i> divided into 6 families. Each unit bears a name that begins with the syllable <strong>&quot;Ra-&quot;</strong>. Their weapons and powers are directly derived from this. For example, the <strong>Rapier</strong> fights with rapiers, the <strong>Ragout</strong> cooks delicious meals to strengthen allies, and the <strong>Radioactive</strong> spreads a deadly gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies, the <strong>Cats</strong>, also draw their powers from their names, which begin with the syllable <strong>&quot;Cha-&quot;</strong>, such as the <strong>Carpenter</strong>, the <strong>Shaman</strong>, or even the fearsome <strong>Chardasso</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ratatata</i> is an isometric Tower Defense game where you lead a space rat kingdom fending off a ruthless cat invasion! Fight across diverse environments and adapt your strategies to survive the relentless waves of these fierce felines!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 24 <i>racruits</i> divided into 6 families. Each unit bears a name that begins with the syllable <strong>&quot;Ra-&quot;</strong>. Their weapons and powers are directly derived from this. For example, the <strong>Rapier</strong> fights with rapiers, the <strong>Ragout</strong> cooks delicious meals to strengthen allies, and the <strong>Radioactive</strong> spreads a deadly gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies, the <strong>Cats</strong>, also draw their powers from their names, which begin with the syllable <strong>&quot;Cha-&quot;</strong>, such as the <strong>Carpenter</strong>, the <strong>Shaman</strong>, or even the fearsome <strong>Chardasso</strong>!</p>",
